From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:24:02 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 023/230] Extract the shared contexts and helpers out of the
 component modules
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New src/lib/cx.ts, src/lib/clubContext.ts, src/lib/adaptComments.ts,
src/components/toastContext.ts, src/hooks/authContext.ts,
src/hooks/usePullToRefresh.ts and src/i18n/context.ts. Consumers now import
the context or helper they need (toast, auth, i18n, club list, comment
adapter, class-name joiner, pull-to-refresh) instead of reaching through a
component module, which is what let MatchDetail and friends drop their
remaining pitch-era imports.

The entrance stagger, the streak icon and the reflow of the touched files
came in with the same pass.

